<title>SINGAPORE: Pan Pacific  PPPS SI net loss deepens by 60.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Pan Pacific  PPPS SI net loss deepens by 60.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			1.34     vs     0.83</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)		nil	vs     1.25</p>
<p>Group share (cts)	  (2.45)    vs    (1.67)</p>
<p>    Turnover		     41.40     vs    42.41</p>
<p>    Interest income	     0.87     vs     0.67</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    0.93     vs     0.74</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  4.39     vs     2.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit/loss	(1.09)    vs     0.34</p>
<p>    Associates		   (0.07)    vs    (0.58)</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.20     vs     0.62</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    (8.05)    vs	nil</p>
<p>Note - Pan Pacific Public Co Ltd said the extraordinary items comprised a write-off of investment in associated company, Channel KTV Pte Ltd and forgiveness of loan to a subsidiary for investment in Channel KTV. It also included gains from disposal of leasehold property by a subsidiary and loss on disposal of investments in associated companies.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
